onk, Folio Society, published 1985, page 217:"}, {"text": "The Celebrity, by arts unknown, induced Mrs. Judge Short and two other ladies to call at Mohair on a certain afternoon when Mr. Cooke was trying a trotter on the track. The three returned wondering and charmed with Mrs. Cooke; they were sure she had had no hand in the furnishing of that atrocious house.", "reference": "1897 December (indicated as 1898), Winston Churchill, chapter IV, in The Celebrity: An Episode, New York, N.Y.: The Macmillan Company; London: Macmillan & Co., Ltd., →OCLC, page 58:"}, {"text": "Let's make sandwiches out of colored paper and teach people how to listen. Listening is a social art and we had best hang on to it. A tape recording stuck in your ear won't do.", "reference": "1983 December 3, “Personal advertisement”, in Gay Community News, volume 11, number 20, page 21:"}], "synonyms": [], "antonyms": [], "translations": [{"language": {"code": "af", "name": "Afrikaans"}, "word": "kuns"}, {"language": {"code": "ar", "name": "Arabic"}, "word": "فَنّ"}, {"language": {"code": "ar", "name": "Arabic"}, "word": "فُنُون"}, {"language": {"code": "zh", "name": "Chinese Mandarin"}, "word": "藝術 /艺术"}, {"language": {"code": "nl", "name": "Dutch"}, "word": "kunst"}, {"language": {"code": "fi", "name": "Finnish"}, "word": "kuvataide"}, {"language": {"code": "fi", "name": "Finnish"}, "word": "taide"}, {"language": {"code": "fi", "name": "Finnish"}, "word": "kuvaamataito"}, {"language": {"code": "fr", "name": "French"}, "word": "art"}, {"language": {"code": "ga", "name": "Irish"}, "word": "ealaín"}, {"language": {"code": "it", "name": "Italian"}, "word": "arte"}, {"language": {"code": "kn", "name": "Kannada"}, "word": "ಕಲೆ"}, {"language": {"code": "la", "name": "Latin"}, "word": "ars"}, {"language": {"code": "pt", "name": "Portuguese"}, "word": "arte"}, {"language": {"code": "ru", "name": "Russian"}, "word": "иску́сство"}, {"language": {"code": "sk", "name": "Slovak"}, "word": "umenie"}, {"language":